      "Title": "KYS.EFCore.Library.DBContext.ActionLog",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/KYS.EFCore.Library.DBContext.ActionLog.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Represents a single audit record written by <xref href=\"KYS.EFCore.Library.DBContext.ApplicationDbContext.SaveChangesWithAuditAsync(System.Nullable%7bSystem.Guid%7d%2cSystem.Nullable%7bKYS.Library.Helpers.FormattingHelper.Formatting%7d)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.\n<br><br>\nMapped to the <code>ActionLog</code> table, or <code>action_log</code> (snake_case columns) when the provider is PostgreSQL (Npgsql).</p>\n"
    },
