      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/KYS.EFCore.Library.DBContext.ApplicationDbContext.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Base <xref href=\"Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.DbContext\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> that provides an <xref href=\"KYS.EFCore.Library.DBContext.ActionLog\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> table and\naudit-aware saving through <xref href=\"KYS.EFCore.Library.DBContext.ApplicationDbContext.SaveChangesWithAuditAsync(System.Nullable%7bSystem.Guid%7d%2cSystem.Nullable%7bKYS.Library.Helpers.FormattingHelper.Formatting%7d)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.\n<br><br>\nDerive from this class to add your own <xref href=\"Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.DbSet%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> properties.</p>\n"
